        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "18 St Josephs Road, Walkinstown, Dublin 12\r\n\r\nDavid Ross Estate Agents your local property experts are delighted to present new to the market no.18 St Josephs Road. This fine 3 bed 2 bath property comes in excellent condition throughout and has been well maintained by its previous owners with new wiring .\r\n\r\nLocated in the ever popular area of Walkinstown, number 18 has all you need in terms of local amenities. To include many shops, cafes and restaurants, sports clubs, schools and many more.\r\n\r\nEntering this fantastic property you are immediately met with a bright and open entrance hallway. Moving through the property you have a spacious open plan living area. This includes a small reception room to the front and a second larger reception room, an ideal space for relaxing or entertaining. Just past this space you have a small conservatory room which could be utilised as a separate laundry room. Towards the rear of the property you have a modern and fully equipped extended kitchen/dining area. Downstairs also comprises a small but convenient bathroom.\r\n\r\nTo the rear you have a private and sunny garden with a good sized shed to the rear which leads to lane access behind the property.\r\n\r\nUpstairs you have a double bedroom alongside a fully tiled family bathroom to the rear and a double bedroom alongside a single bedroom to the front aspect.\r\n\r\nThis property benefits from great public transport links with several bus routes in close proximity providing easy access to the City Centre. The M50 and N7 motorways are also only a short drive away, opening up access to the Greater Dublin Area and surrounding counties.\r\n\r\nThis superb property is not one to be missed.\r\nViewing by appointment only.\r\n\r\nKey features:\r\n- Prime location\r\n- Off street parking\r\n- Lane access \r\n- Extended\r\n- Local amenities"
      },
      {
